sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operator
  participant C as Conductor (Wonder)
  participant W as Worker (Glimmer)
  participant V as Verifier
  participant H as Human approver
  U->>C: Kick off scope (goal created on Muse)
  C->>W: Assignment: discover and extract Texas
  W-->>C: Proposal with snapshot citations
  C->>V: Verify independently
  V-->>C: Verdict (pass, or exception)
  C-->>H: Approved-ready queue with diffs and evidence
  H-->>C: Approve (last step)
  C->>C: Publish effective-dated, monitor forever
